    # ---------- Reader annotations ----------
    Ann_Randomization:
      type: bpmn:TextAnnotation
      text: >-
        Random allocation applies to the human cohort only; artificial agents
        run the full factorial, so path contrasts hold within a family.
      bounds:
        x: 1130
        "y": 400
        width: 240
        height: 90
      stroke: "#ce9d35"
      fill: "#fbe7cf"
      background-color: "#fbe7cf"
      border-color: "#ce9d35"
    Assoc_Ann_Randomization:
      type: bpmn:Association
      sourceRef: Randomize_Gateway
      targetRef: Ann_Randomization
      waypoint:
        - x: 585
          "y": 420
        - x: 1130
          "y": 440
      stroke: "#ce9d35"
      border-color: "#ce9d35"
    Ann_Interface:
      type: bpmn:TextAnnotation
      text: >-
        One interface, any actor: the runner drives humans, language models,
        and bots through the same per-trial message-passing loop; every trial
        is logged to the BDM trials dataset under the declared schema.
      bounds:
        x: 1130
        "y": 780
        width: 240
        height: 120
      stroke: "#ce9d35"
      fill: "#fbe7cf"
      background-color: "#fbe7cf"
      border-color: "#ce9d35"
    Assoc_Ann_Interface:
      type: bpmn:Association
      sourceRef: Battery
      targetRef: Ann_Interface
      waypoint:
        - x: 790
          "y": 800
        - x: 1130
          "y": 820
      stroke: "#ce9d35"
      border-color: "#ce9d35"
    Ann_Attrition:
      type: bpmn:TextAnnotation
      text: >-
        Attrition is control flow, not a side note: every exit is a boundary
        error event, and the runner writes the participant-flow counts onto
        these events at run time (the CONSORT projection).
      bounds:
        x: 1130
        "y": 1260
        width: 240
        height: 120
      stroke: "#ce9d35"
      fill: "#fbe7cf"
      background-color: "#fbe7cf"
      border-color: "#ce9d35"
    Assoc_Ann_Attrition:
      type: bpmn:Association
      sourceRef: Discontinued
      targetRef: Ann_Attrition
      waypoint:
        - x: 978
          "y": 1190
        - x: 1130
          "y": 1290
      stroke: "#ce9d35"
      border-color: "#ce9d35"
    Ann_Preregistration:
      type: bpmn:TextAnnotation
      text: >-
        The pipeline is the preregistration: operation types, inputs, outputs,
        thresholds, and margins are attributes of these nodes, fixed before the
        first run; implementations are pinned via versioned `uses` references.
      bounds:
        x: 1130
        "y": 1980
        width: 240
        height: 130
      stroke: "#ce9d35"
      fill: "#fbe7cf"
      background-color: "#fbe7cf"
      border-color: "#ce9d35"
    Assoc_Ann_Preregistration:
      type: bpmn:Association
      sourceRef: Analysis
      targetRef: Ann_Preregistration
      waypoint:
        - x: 860
          "y": 2000
        - x: 1130
          "y": 2030
      stroke: "#ce9d35"
      border-color: "#ce9d35"
